<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Now then, I will guide you to the next arc―
{PAUSE ""}
or so I would like to say, but...<PG>
You have not yet viewed the route in which the Megasawa City case occurs and which leads to the Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse] and the Meicho Arc [Clear Sign].<PG>
Before going on to the next arc, I would like you to view that one.<PG>
Why did the occurrence of the Megasawa City case end up giving rise to the many ghastly incidents, beginning with the Motoki-cho flayed-body case?<PG>
Please, confirm it with your own eyes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
